{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122515","id":4300143286,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAE76tg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122515","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122515.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122515.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122515","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122515/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122515/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122515/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/247dad1b7d68ee0ad4ac52805465ad751b47b740","number":122515,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"visionOS XR module: Fix error when using MSAA on visionOS","user":{"login":"oPinon","id":5775700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzU3MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5775700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon","html_url":"https://github.com/oPinon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oPinon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes an error when using MSAA on Apple Vision Pro.\r\nBefore this fix, using MSAA leads to the app rendering black/transparent, and the following error being printed:\r\n```\r\nservers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:3325:_render_pass_create(): Invalid framebuffer depth resolve format attachment(4), in pass (0), it's marked as depth, but it's not a depth resolve attachment. Condition \"!(p_attachments[attachment].usage_flags & TEXTURE_USAGE_DEPTH_RESOLVE_ATTACHMENT_BIT)\" is true. Returning: RDD::RenderPassID()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR is a follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120231\r\n\r\nI tested it by:\r\n1. cloning one of the XR [godot-demo-projects](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/xr) (such as [openxr_origin_centric_movement](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/xr/openxr_origin_centric_movement))\r\n2. modifying it to use the \"visionOS\" XRInterface\r\n3. toggling anti-aliasing in the project settings\r\n\r\nHere are the results:\r\n| | Without MSAA | With MSAA |\r\n| - | - | - |\r\n| Project Settings | <img width=\"914\" height=\"209\" alt=\"Settings no MSAA\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae8ad5d1-dcfc-4bc9-85fe-854255e7f017\" /> | <img width=\"914\" height=\"209\" alt=\"Settings with MSAA\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13684659-92cf-468a-a7fa-53107c7545eb\" /> |\r\n| Metal GPU capture | <img width=\"1113\" height=\"686\" alt=\"GPU Capture no MSAA\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75e8b5f7-43e2-403a-a34a-803936b31fbc\" /> | <img width=\"1223\" height=\"908\" alt=\"GPU Capture MSAA\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e183806-7bed-4e58-bde6-5d037d0b256f\" /> |","labels":[{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9548448620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACOSHDbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:visionos","name":"platform:visionos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-17T23:55:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T23:23:36Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T22:21:39Z","merged_at":"2026-08-19T22:21:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"bfdeb5f7bd732d3c814229fff8a385976b220e67","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"oPinon:apple/visionos-xr-1-msaa-depth-resolve